	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[connexion perdue en créant une extension postgis]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=26548#p26548"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Je bute... Quand j&#039;essaye d&#039;ajouter l&#039;extension postgis à une base (create extension postgis;) j&#039;obtiens le message :</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>server closed the connection unexpectedly<br />&#160; &#160; This probably means the server terminated abnormally<br />&#160; &#160; before or while processing the request.<br />The connection to the server was lost. Attempting reset: Failed.</p></div></blockquote></div><p>Si je vais voir dans le log :</p><div class="quotebox"><blockquote><div><p>2017-12-19 15:44:02 CET [20807-7] LOG:&#160; server process (PID 21127) was terminated by signal 6: Aborted<br />2017-12-19 15:44:02 CET [20807-8] DETAIL:&#160; Failed process was running: CREATE EXTENSION postgis<br />2017-12-19 15:44:02 CET [20807-9] LOG:&#160; terminating any other active server processes<br />2017-12-19 15:44:02 CET [21019-2] WARNING:&#160; terminating connection because of crash of another server process</p></div></blockquote></div><p>J&#039;ai tenté de multiples désinstallations/résintallations, en me référant notamment à ce poste : <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2748607/how-to-thoroughly-purge-and-reinstall-postgresql-on-ubuntu" rel="nofollow">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/274 … -on-ubuntu</a></p><p>Mais je bloque... Quelqu&#039;un aurait-il une idée ? Un grand merci !</p>]]></content>
